Chinese singer Li Yuchun also performed <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/03/18/apple-ceo-tim-cook-visits-china/">at Apple's Taikoo Li store in Chengdu, China</a> last week, as part of the celebrations. ↓<br/>
